er in this sentence  you know talking about when we were  playing me magic Larry and I'm not be  too presumptuous here but I just  remember that you know and Isiah Thomas  and and Dumars and you know all those  guys it was all about it was all about  the big prize and I love the fact that  that documentary really focused on the  obsession with Championships and I think  it's a great message for today's players  because look back in those days nobody  even had cell phones and I mean let  alone social media  all the different kinds of distractions  and things going on today and there's a  lot more money flying around today etc  you know the the focus and the emphasis  on winning titles was just that was that  was a beautiful thing for me to say I've  been fortunate to be on two championship  teams in the NBA in one playing and one  coaching I know and I know how hard it  is and and that feeling you get you know  when when you get when you get to the  end and you've and you've accomplished  it I mean it's a it's a it's a magical  magical feeling that can never be  duplicated Rick thanks for the call  really appreciate it enjoyed our  conversation good luck with you as you  get to Disney World and and hopefully  everybody is safe and healthy and we I  can't wait to watch the competition  thank you for the call  all right that's Rick Carlisle the head  coach of the Dallas Mavericks  hey you watched all the way to the end  thanks for that watch more right here

